// The Sacred Tree town MVP: a compact clearing ringed by pines, with the
// tree at its center. The supply (sacred_tree_supply.ron) puts the tree's
// wood and stone piles beside it, the elder and the four sprites on its +z
// side and one Wood Gatherer to the west (-x); the east side (+x) is left
// open to build on. Scene x and z are the supply's positions.
//
// The clearing tops a hill in the middle of 256 x 256 m of generated ground
// to dig for stone (Dig Lab's terraces, sloped): a plateau 31 m square and
// 2 m (8 steps) above the ground round it, with cliff sides, and a ramp
// 7 m wide and 8 m long down the middle of its west (-x) and east (+x)
// sides, one per wave lane. The plateau's top is the ground's zero, so the
// clearing stands where it did; the hill and its ramps can't be dug, at
// any depth. Round its foot the ground stays flat for 10 m.
//
// The ground is a volume (M8.3 of the depths design): the mine's terraces
// and hill become solid cells at load, 16 layers (8 m) deep under the
// surface (`dig_layers`) and one of bedrock, a quarter-meter terrace step
// rounded down to the half-meter layer under it. Its stone veins go on
// down, richer deeper; amber lies in pockets from 4 m down, and in the
// mountain below. The elder digs it in 3D (F, Ctrl+F, Alt+F).
Scene(id: "sacred-tree", player: "elder", features: [Digging, SlopedGround], dig_layers: Some(16), name: "THE SACRED TREE / TOWN MVP", spawn: (0.0, 0.0, 3.4), industrial: false, instances: [

],
mine: Some((extent: 128.0, seed: 7, hill: Some((plateau: 15, height: 8, ramp_width: 7, ramp_length: 8, foot: 10)))),
// A mountain spur north of the town (-z, away from the wave lanes along
// x), applied over the generated volume: tiles x -16..4, z -68..-47, its
// foot 47 m from the tree, nine 1 m tiers a tile in each (its face to the
// town, +z, a cliff for its first four), topped at 8 m (layer 16), 9 m
// over the ground round it (-1 m). A cave mouth in the middle of its face:
// a hall x -8..-4 from z -47 to -53 (7 tiles in), floor -1 m (layer -2),
// 3 m high, with a passage west x -11..-9, z -52..-50, 2.5 m high. Amber
// in its rock: the hall's west wall by the mouth, its back wall, the
// passage's end, and a pocket deep inside. Units are cells: tiles from the
// tree's and 0.5 m layers (`volume::VolumeLayout`).
volume: Some((extent: 128, boxes: [
Solid(min: (-16, -68), max: (4, -47), bottom: -6, top: 0),
Solid(min: (-15, -67), max: (3, -47), bottom: -6, top: 2),
Solid(min: (-14, -66), max: (2, -47), bottom: -6, top: 4),
Solid(min: (-13, -65), max: (1, -47), bottom: -6, top: 6),
Solid(min: (-12, -64), max: (0, -48), bottom: -6, top: 8),
Solid(min: (-11, -63), max: (-1, -49), bottom: -6, top: 10),
Solid(min: (-10, -62), max: (-2, -50), bottom: -6, top: 12),
Solid(min: (-9, -61), max: (-3, -51), bottom: -6, top: 14),
Solid(min: (-8, -60), max: (-4, -52), bottom: -6, top: 16),
Solid(min: (-9, -49), max: (-9, -48), bottom: -1, top: 2, material: AmberOre),
Solid(min: (-7, -54), max: (-5, -54), bottom: 0, top: 3, material: AmberOre),
Solid(min: (-12, -52), max: (-12, -50), bottom: -1, top: 2, material: AmberOre),
Solid(min: (-13, -60), max: (-11, -58), bottom: 4, top: 8, material: AmberOre),
Empty(min: (-8, -53), max: (-4, -47), bottom: -2, top: 4),
Empty(min: (-11, -52), max: (-9, -50), bottom: -2, top: 3),
])),
// The light through the day and night (the supply's day cycle: dawn at the
// start, dusk at 2:30). Noon is the forest style's light; dusk is golden,
// amber where dawn is rosy; the moon is dim, so the night's own lights
// matter.
day_cycle: Some((
  dawn: (sunlight: (1.0, 0.68, 0.42), illuminance: 11000.0, ambient: (0.74, 0.70, 0.72), ambient_brightness: 600.0, sky: (0.38, 0.30, 0.27), fog_density: 0.004),
  noon: (sunlight: (1.0, 0.96, 0.88), illuminance: 14000.0, ambient: (0.66, 0.79, 0.92), ambient_brightness: 800.0, sky: (0.16, 0.22, 0.18), fog_density: 0.003),
  dusk: (sunlight: (1.0, 0.74, 0.42), illuminance: 13000.0, ambient: (0.80, 0.71, 0.60), ambient_brightness: 820.0, sky: (0.34, 0.25, 0.15), fog_density: 0.0035),
  midnight: (sunlight: (0.55, 0.68, 1.0), illuminance: 1800.0, ambient: (0.32, 0.42, 0.78), ambient_brightness: 150.0, sky: (0.015, 0.025, 0.06), fog_density: 0.004),
)),
// The night's lights, lit from late afternoon to full in the evening and
// out soon after dawn: the tree's warm glow under its canopy, lighting the
// plaza (its piles and the sprites' idle spot), and lanterns, one each side
// of the top of each ramp (the plateau's edge is 15.5 m out, the ramps 7 m
// wide) and four round the plaza. Drawn only: nothing walks round them.
glow: Some((position: (0.0, 2.6, 0.0), color: (1.0, 0.72, 0.40), intensity: 2000000.0, range: 20.0)),
lanterns: [
(position: (14.6, 0.0, -4.4)), (position: (14.6, 0.0, 4.4)),
(position: (-14.6, 0.0, -4.4)), (position: (-14.6, 0.0, 4.4)),
(position: (3.4, 0.0, 6.4)), (position: (-3.4, 0.0, 6.4)),
(position: (4.6, 0.0, -4.6)), (position: (-4.6, 0.0, -4.6))
],
